WEBVTT

01:58:09.000 --> 01:58:15.999
Ja, from here...

01:58:16.000 --> 01:58:18.999
We came over here, so now...

01:58:19.000 --> 01:58:23.999
Go over there...

01:58:24.000 --> 01:58:26.999
Then go this way...

01:58:27.000 --> 01:58:31.999
Right?

01:58:32.000 --> 01:58:34.999
It won’t work. It won’t move from here at all.

01:58:35.000 --> 01:58:37.999
The fact that it won’t move here

01:58:38.000 --> 01:58:39.999
is the problem.

01:58:40.000 --> 01:58:44.999
Let’s try the right side first.

01:58:45.000 --> 01:58:51.999
No, not that—the pillar over there.

01:58:52.000 --> 01:58:59.999
That probably won’t work. Grab it there.

01:59:00.000 --> 01:59:01.999
Got it. Wrapping around from the right...

01:59:02.000 --> 01:59:06.999
This might work. Like this.

01:59:07.000 --> 01:59:10.999
Go in a little farther...

01:59:11.000 --> 01:59:12.999
[Music]

01:59:13.000 --> 01:59:15.999
There we go.

01:59:16.000 --> 01:59:16.999
That’s it—left.

01:59:17.000 --> 01:59:18.999
To the left.

01:59:19.000 --> 01:59:19.999
Wrapped around it.

01:59:20.000 --> 01:59:24.999
It’s going in. This might work!

01:59:25.000 --> 01:59:31.999
Oh!

01:59:32.000 --> 01:59:33.999
What do we do now?

01:59:34.000 --> 01:59:34.999
Wow!

01:59:35.000 --> 01:59:40.999
We did it!

01:59:41.000 --> 01:59:48.999
Did we? What’s next?

01:59:49.000 --> 01:59:50.999
We did it. What do we do next?

01:59:51.000 --> 01:59:56.999
They say to go down.

01:59:57.000 --> 02:00:06.999
Going down.

02:00:07.000 --> 02:00:09.999
Try pressing it.

02:00:10.000 --> 02:00:12.999
No, that’s not it.

02:00:13.000 --> 02:00:17.999
It’s for making a toy.

02:00:18.000 --> 02:00:27.999
A toy!

02:00:28.000 --> 02:00:29.999
It’s lit up, so it must be...

02:00:30.000 --> 02:00:36.999
something important.

02:00:37.000 --> 02:00:40.999
Pull it?

02:00:41.000 --> 02:00:41.999
Did you pull it?

02:00:42.000 --> 02:00:43.999
We need to

02:00:44.000 --> 02:00:48.999
turn on the machine.

02:00:49.000 --> 02:00:54.999
How do we turn it on?

02:00:55.000 --> 02:00:57.999
This looks like the way to power the machine.

02:00:58.000 --> 02:01:13.999
Right.

02:01:14.000 --> 02:01:18.999
I’m pressing everything.

02:01:19.000 --> 02:01:47.999
Where do we turn the machine on?

02:01:48.000 --> 02:01:51.999
I’m going to get a glass of water.

02:01:52.000 --> 02:01:55.999
They say to follow the power cable.

02:01:56.000 --> 02:01:57.999
Wait.

02:01:58.000 --> 02:02:00.999
Oh, here’s the power cable.

02:02:01.000 --> 02:02:02.999
Isn’t this the one leading away?

02:02:03.000 --> 02:02:04.999
This one.

02:02:05.000 --> 02:02:13.999
Here’s the power cable.

02:02:14.000 --> 02:02:19.999
That’s it.

02:02:20.000 --> 02:02:24.999
It runs the other way, over here.

02:02:25.000 --> 02:02:29.999
We have to go back up.

02:02:30.000 --> 02:02:36.999
We need to go upstairs again.

02:10:31.000 --> 02:10:34.999
What was that sound? Oh, it’s there!

02:10:35.000 --> 02:10:37.999
Are you kidding me?

02:10:38.000 --> 02:10:40.999
Ja, I think you can take over now, hyung.

02:10:41.000 --> 02:10:47.999
[Music]

02:10:48.000 --> 02:10:53.999
Wait—my hand looks scarier right now.

02:10:54.000 --> 02:11:03.999
Come on in. I’ll give it a try.

02:11:04.000 --> 02:11:09.999
Could you just handle this part?

02:11:10.000 --> 02:11:43.999
I’ll control the mouse.

02:11:44.000 --> 02:11:55.999
[Music]

02:11:56.000 --> 02:11:59.999
[Applause]

02:12:00.000 --> 02:12:02.999
This is it! This is what I was waiting for.

02:12:03.000 --> 02:12:05.999
We have to go back?

02:12:06.000 --> 02:12:09.999
Then is it over?

02:12:10.000 --> 02:12:37.999
Oh, we have to avoid that thing.

02:12:38.000 --> 02:12:44.999
I’ll do it! I’ll do it! I’ll do it!

02:12:45.000 --> 02:12:48.999
Where are we supposed to run?

02:12:49.000 --> 02:12:49.999
Ah!

02:12:50.000 --> 02:12:50.999
[Music]

02:12:51.000 --> 02:12:56.999
Ah! Ah!

02:12:57.000 --> 02:12:59.999
Where are its eyes?

02:13:00.000 --> 02:13:00.999
Is it this way?

02:13:01.000 --> 02:13:02.999
Do we lose it and go in over there?

02:13:03.000 --> 02:13:04.999
Look.

02:13:05.000 --> 02:13:06.999
It’s going to come out.

02:13:07.000 --> 02:13:07.999
Yes.

02:13:08.000 --> 02:13:10.999
Yes, yes—let’s not look at its face.

02:13:11.000 --> 02:13:11.999
Just...

02:13:12.000 --> 02:13:15.999
circle around—no, left! Left!

02:13:16.000 --> 02:13:17.999
To the left!

02:13:18.000 --> 02:13:19.999
Just go around it once.

02:13:20.000 --> 02:13:28.999
That’s it.

02:13:29.000 --> 02:13:36.999
Okay, okay, okay!

02:13:37.000 --> 02:13:45.999
Why is my neck bent like this?

02:13:46.000 --> 02:13:47.999
[Music]

02:13:48.000 --> 02:13:54.999
I’m not scared anymore.

02:13:55.000 --> 02:13:58.999
I’m not scared now. This is the way—yes, there!
